{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>「JPG Optimizer PRO」是一款專為優化照片大小而設的實用工具。它能智能壓縮你的影像檔案，讓照片在保持視覺品質的同時，大幅減少儲存空間佔用，並解決因檔案過大導致的電郵無法傳送問題。應用目前正限時免費，原價為 US $0.99。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-193.webp\">\n<h2>專業級影像壓縮功能</h2>\n<p>「JPG Optimizer PRO」運用尖端壓縮技術，能在保持視覺品質的前提下，將照片檔案有效縮小高達 35%。這可解決電郵附件過大導致的傳送問題，並顯著釋放裝置儲存空間。應用提供精準品質控制、EXIF/GPS 資料管理、智能尺寸調整及批量優化功能，且所有影像處理均於裝置上離線完成，全面保障用戶私隱。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-240-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-241-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-242-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-243-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：JPG Optimizer PRO</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T04:58:38.193953+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":339,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T04:47:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T06:03:18.249464+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T04:57:34.052033+00:00","content_hash":"7f43e9a387acae43c2a018f84f52d51bcc44e5cc0346cf4f111803e54de21899","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}